<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0686_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hillary</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0686_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’d love to do some more scrap prep and\nreview with you...\rThat’s it! Swap numbers with me?\fThere WILL be homework. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0686_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight, I’m lookin’ forward to talkin’\nagain. I’ll call if anythin’ come up!\fPop quizzes count.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0686_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, you should listen when Teachers is\ntalkin’ to you!\fDetention.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0686_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You change your mind about\nswappin’ numbers? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0686_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know, I’m pretty sure I just saw\nyou...\rIf you right nearby, don’t talk over\nthe phone. Talk to me in person.\fNo phones in class.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0686_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">AYO!\rYou got ANOTHER zero on a test!\nYou don’t pay attention to NOTHIN’ I\fsay, do you? You think you can beat a\fBlock Boss with that kinda...\rHuh?\rYou ain’t Travis...\rOh my goodness! My bad!\nTell Travis to call me. He’s in TROUBLE.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0686_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I usually run {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0}.\rDon’t you love scrappin’ with your fave\nhomie?\rBut it get lonely usin’ the same homie.\rSometimes I walk with homies I just\ncaught. Mad fun!\fI grade them too. On a curve.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0686_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The other day I was scrappin’ {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}\non Route 15 and a HUGE crowd stopped\fto\fwatch!\fI got SO nervous...\rI’m used to talkin’ in front of a class\nof kids... but scraps is different!\fNobody’s sleepin’ in the back.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0686_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know...\nThis stay between us, right?\rI was tryna catch a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}.\rI threw the WRONG Nap Sack and the\nhomie dipped.\rGood thing none of my students saw.\nThey’d NEVER lemme live it down.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0686_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">By the way, you’d like to prep for\nscraps and do some review,\fwouldn’t you?\rWe shoulda another scrap!\rI’m always on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}.\nI’ll be waitin’ for you there!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0686_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo! You remember you made plans\nwith me?\rWe said we was finna meet on\n{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0} and have a\fscrap, right? Don’t forget!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0686_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If you ask me which is cuter, my\nstudents or homies, I’mma have a hard\ftime\fmakin’ that call.\fIt’s the homies. Don’t tell ’em.\rFor a lotta kids, their first homie is\nthe cutest one in the world.\rAin’t NOTHIN’ you can say to change\nthat.</language>
	</row>
</body>
